We need to answer: "What two cities have publication offices of the weekly newsmagazine which also has a publication office in the capital and largest city of the autonomous community of the Balearic Islands in Spain?" The weekly newsmagazine is El Temps. Evidence says: "The publication has offices in Barcelona, Valencia and Palma." Palma is the capital and largest city of the Balearic Islands. The question asks: "What two cities have publication offices of the weekly newsmagazine which also has a publication office in the capital and largest city of the autonomous community of the Balearic Islands in Spain?" So they want the other two cities besides Palma: Barcelona and Valencia.

Thus answer: Barcelona and Valencia.

